@bio:

Rosalba Agresta is a research curator at the Music
Department of the Bibliothèque nationale de France. She
holds a PhD from the École Pratique des Hautes Études
(Paris), where she defended a dissertation on Chopin’s
reception in Britain. Her research interests include
19th-century musical life, music genetics, and reception
studies.


@@END: BIO
